<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">

<head>
  <%- include("components/seo-head", {
        title: "About DevHub",
        description: "DevHub is a platform for discovering, reviewing, and sharing open-source projects. Combining the discovery experience of GitHub and Product Hunt, DevHub focuses on real project quality and community feedback.",
        canonicalPath: "/about",
        keywords: "about DevHub, open source, open-source projects, developer platform, software discovery"
    }) %>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include("components/header") %>

  <main class="static-page about-page">
    <h1>About DevHub</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      DevHub is a platform for
      <strong>discovering, reviewing, and sharing</strong>
      software projects, with a focus on real-world quality rather
      than just the number of stars a project receives.
    </p>

    <div class="static-card">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0">Why DevHub?</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Discovering great projects can be difficult.
          GitHub stars do not always reflect a project's actual quality.
        </li>
        <li>
          Constructive feedback is often limited.
          DevHub provides ratings, satisfaction scores, and detailed reviews.
        </li>
        <li>
          Demos, downloads, and documentation are brought together
          in one convenient place.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Who Is DevHub For?</h2>

    <div class="static-card">
      <p>
        <strong>Developers</strong> — Discover similar projects
        before starting something new.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Project Owners</strong> — Receive meaningful feedback
        and increase your project's visibility.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 0">
        <strong>Explorers</strong> — Discover useful tools,
        innovative ideas, and high-quality projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Core Features</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Automatic synchronization with GitHub</li>
      <li>Reviews with ratings and percentage-based satisfaction scores</li>
      <li>Nested comments and threaded discussions</li>
      <li>Project discovery powered by a Hot Score algorithm</li>
      <li>Tags and categories for organized project discovery</li>
    </ul>

    <p style="margin-top: 28px">
      <a href="/explore" class="btn-primary">
        Start Exploring
      </a>

      <a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="margin-left: 10px">
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </p>
  </main>

  <%- include("components/footer") %>
</body>

</html>